{
  "_comment": "Every face the installation ships (design-system.md §3), read by build/fonts.js, test/fonts.test.js and infrastructure/i18n/ScriptFaces_test.go. `scripts` maps each ISO 15924 script the face is there for to a few of its letters; `blocks` bounds a script face to its script's Unicode blocks, so that a character other faces share never fetches it; `weights` declares a static file over a range of weights; `subsets` keeps only those of a package's stylesheet blocks; `notice` names the licence text under third-party/licenses/_bundled/.",
